# From story0420_5f: descend to 4F, win four ordinary encounters,
# heal all three allies with Yosuke's Dia between encounters, then Goho-M out and save.
# Use two Medicines for Yu/Chie, set Yosuke to Heal/Support, and use weapons against Electric-repel King.
# The first two encounters can finish before Yu gets any COMMAND.
# Configure Heal/Support during the third encounter, not by waiting in those easy fights.
